#: features.js:729
msgid "Silence"
msgstr "Tišina"

#: features.js:730
msgid "Soft background noise"
msgstr "Mekani pozadinski šum"

#: features.js:731
msgid "A gentle chime to mark time"
msgstr "Nježno zvonce za označavanje vremena"

#: features.js:732
msgid "I share my space — keep it quiet"
msgstr "Dijelim prostor — neka bude tiho"

#: features.js:734
msgid "How much do you want to get done today?"
msgstr "Koliko želite obaviti danas?"

#: features.js:735
msgid "Sets your daily goal — no pressure, you can change it."
msgstr "Postavlja vaš dnevni cilj — bez pritiska, možete ga promijeniti."

#: features.js:737
msgid "Just trying it out"
msgstr "Samo isprobavam"

#: features.js:738
msgid "A light day (about 4)"
msgstr "Lagan dan (oko 4)"

#: features.js:739
msgid "A full day (about 6)"
msgstr "Pun dan (oko 6)"

#: features.js:740
msgid "A big push (about 8)"
msgstr "Veliki iskorak (oko 8)"

#: features.js:756
msgid "Smart setup"
msgstr "Pametno postavljanje"

#: features.js:765
msgid "Skip"
msgstr "Preskoči"

#: features.js:768
msgid "Let's tune Zen Pomodoro to you 🍅"
msgstr "Prilagodimo Zen Pomodoro vama 🍅"

#: features.js:769
msgid ""
"Answer five quick questions and I'll build a focus setup that fits how you "
"work — your rhythm, sounds, breaks and the help you need. You can fine-tune "
"everything later in Settings."
msgstr ""
"Odgovorite na pet kratkih pitanja i složit ću postavku fokusa koja odgovara "
"vašem načinu rada — vaš ritam, zvukove, predahe i pomoć koja vam treba. Sve "
"možete kasnije fino ugoditi u Postavkama."

#: features.js:770
msgid "Let's go"
msgstr "Krenimo"

#: features.js:776 features.js:792
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Natrag"

#: features.js:777
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Dalje"

#: features.js:780
msgid "Your tailored setup 🍅"
msgstr "Vaša prilagođena postavka 🍅"

#: features.js:781
msgid ""
"Based on your answers, here's what I'll set up. Apply it now, then tweak "
"anything in Settings."
msgstr ""
"Na temelju vaših odgovora, evo što ću postaviti. Primijenite sada, a zatim "
"podesite bilo što u Postavkama."

#: features.js:793
msgid "Apply"
msgstr "Primijeni"

#: features.js:794
msgid "Apply & start"
msgstr "Primijeni i pokreni"

